04:58:41Z–04:58:54Z; native composition ran 04:58:54Z–05:00:39Z (105 seconds).
There was no retry, rebuild, pull, GPU use or real model/data/S3 access.

The exact present-key image `Labels=null` to container `Labels={}` exception now
