The never-started container exported 1,058,599,424 bytes. Safe rootfs extraction
accounted for 28,984 entries / 28,987 physical headers, 1,037,181,068 content bytes,
844 symlinks, two hardlinks and 319 metadata bytes. Exactly two separately bound
